        <a:p><a:r><a:t>Anticipated Q&amp;A:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:t></a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:t>- Why did growth slow if the pipeline looks healthy? Q1 revenue came from 2025 wins; the pipeline closes in H2. Converting at current rates should re-accelerate Q3–Q4.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:t>- Is the NPS drop real or a data artifact? Small sample (28), but directional signal is real. Follow up all detractors within 30 days before concluding.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:t>- Should we be more selective given 40% win rate? Yes — especially sub-$300K single-practice RFPs. Best win rates (50%) are multi-practice Ops/Strategy deals.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:t>- Can we build AI advisory without straining the team? Net-new hires, not reallocation — utilization already 76.2%, near top quartile.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:t>- How exposed is the Financial Services gap? $6.0M weighted vs. firm-wide 4.6× coverage is light, against confirmed regulatory demand — a Q2 outbound priority.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody>
